    "body": "### Problem\n\nThere's error when running nvim -M then `:che` to check health.\n\n```\nE5009: Invalid $VIMRUNTIME: /usr/share/nvim/runtime\nLua: Vim:E21: Cannot make changes, 'modifiable' is off\nstack traceback:\n        [C]: in function 'append'\n        /usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/health.lua:493: in function '_check'\n        [string \"<nvim>\"]:1: in main chunk\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun nvim with -M then `:che`. This error will be there.\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nNo error should be there like when nvim run without -M.\n\n### Nvim version (nvim -v)\n\nNVIM v0.12.3\n\n### Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?\n\nDon't have vim\n\n### Operating system/version\n\nLinux\n\n### Terminal name/version\n\nKitty\n\n### $TERM environment variable\n\nxterm-kitty\n\n### Installation\n\nArch",
